#20700
The East Gate of Vel'Morrow~
   The army road ends at a gate in black walls forty feet high. The gate
stands open, its doors torn from their hinges. A cloud of flies hangs over
the city so thick that the light comes through it brown. The smell is beyond
description. Grey banners hang from every tower.
~
