#20701
The Avenue of Lamps~
   A broad avenue once lit by a thousand lamps runs into the heart of the
city. The lamp posts are hung with bodies now, wrapped in grey cocoons that
twitch. Grey figures walk the avenue in slow processions, ringing small
bells, singing the Choir's long falling note.
~
