#20704
The Rot Market~
   The great market square is still busy. Grey merchants sell grey goods to
grey customers: rotting meat, bolts of cloth woven from hair, jars of
whispering grain. Coins change hands that are only discs of bone. Nobody
speaks. The bells ring.
~
