#20705
The Flesh Tailor's Workshop~
   A tannery turned to a darker trade. Hides hang drying on racks, and they
are not animal hides. Tables hold half-finished works: soldiers stitched
from many bodies, a horse with too many legs. The tailor works at the
largest table, humming, needle flashing.
