#20706
The Cathedral Steps~
   Wide steps climb to the great cathedral of Vel'Morrow, its spires lost in
the cloud of flies. The saints on its facade have been chiselled away and
replaced with spirals. The Choir's note pours from the open doors, ten
thousand voices, loud enough to shake the stones.
~
