#20707
The Nave of the Grey Choir~
   The cathedral's nave is packed with the faithful, standing shoulder to
shoulder, mouths open in the endless note. They face the altar, where a
great spiral of grey stone has replaced the old god. The Grey Choir was born
here, and from here it sends its preachers east.
~
