#20708
The Chancel~
   Behind the altar, the Plague Bishop holds court on a throne of grey
stone. He was the city's bishop when the greyblight came, and he was the
first to welcome it. He conducts the Choir with a staff topped with a
spiral, and the note bends to his will.
~
