#20714
The Palace Gate~
   The ducal palace rises behind a wall of white marble gone yellow and
stained. Its gate is guarded by the duchess's household knights, grey and
swollen in their armour, flies crawling in and out of their visors. Through
the bars you can see the palace, buzzing like a hive.
