#20717
The Throne Room of the Mother of Flies~
   The duchess of Vel'Morrow sits on her throne, and she has grown. She
fills the dais, a vast bloated grey mass in the rags of a gown, her crown
sunk into her swollen head, and from a thousand openings in her body pour
the flies that blot out the sun. She is the plague's heart.
~
