#20720
The Orphanage of Saint Mera~
   A long dormitory of tiny beds, each with a doll on its pillow. The
children of Vel'Morrow were brought here when their parents died, and the
plague followed them. They are still here. They play in the corners, grey
and quiet, and when they see you they smile, all together, and get up.
~
