#20722
The Cathedral Bell Tower~
   A cold stone stair winds up inside the cathedral's bell tower. Its walls
are scratched with tally marks, one for every death the bell was rung for,
until the ringer ran out of wall. Something hunched sits on the stair above,
holding a rope.
